  (text "6. Digital isolator (ISO7761DWR), straddles the 8 mm barrier" (at 15.24 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 0e8668d4-1f84-4b74-9da3-a31bbe9aa5a9))
  (text "Side 1 (hot): BL0939 TX, zero-cross, polarity A/B, alarm in; BL0939 RX out. Side 2 (safe): firmware nets.\nRouted slot under the package. Outputs default high if the other side is unpowered: firmware reads POL_x only while the meter is alive." (at 15.24 29.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 3d8b3766-be67-4f0c-831f-21919a840d61))
  (text "7. Safe-side 5 V supply (Mornsun LD03-23B05R2), straddles the barrier" (at 15.24 77.47 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid b6853aa9-8240-4321-9ff7-7646c9fc4613))
  (text "Genuine Mornsun only. 600 mA, derated to 480 mA at 85 C. Output TVS protects the safe side if the module fails." (at 15.24 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5eda2b56-60c5-498c-8764-de72c90a4fd3))
  (text "8. Outlet relays, coil on the safe side, contacts on the hot side" (at 15.24 113.03 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 2532019f-7ea2-4aa0-a94c-b2a7432f291b))
  (text "Live-only switching (ADR-0002). 8 mm between coil and contact pins with a routed slot. Coil 5 V, 80 mA pull-in." (at 15.24 116.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7964ff63-292c-4fcb-ac43-90b6672b6567))
